      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIM'S BIGHORN (2) ran a much better race here second up when finishing third as the favourite here nearly 3 weeks ago. He has won twice third up in the past, and if he runs up to his good Victorian form, then he is the one to beat. Follow your money. STORMFRONT (3) has yet to his his straps this prep, but drops into the right field here, and from a good draw, a form reversal is on the cards. VIERI (5) was outpaced over 1300m here last time out when following on from a win on this track over 1600m at the start of the season. This is his pet trip, and he can take this out. BIDEN TIME (6) has been in good form down in the grades, and he will drop 8kg from his last start, which should make him very competitive again. MIAMI BABY (7) broke his win drought when capping off some good form with an easy win over this trip nearly 3 weeks ago. This is tougher, but he has top 4 claims again.",
